        "content": "<p>alexcrichton edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14950\">issue #14950</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This program:</p>\n<p>CM#123</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"p\">::{</span><span class=\"n\">Component</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Linker</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"p\">::{</span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Store</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Component</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">r#\"</span>\n<span class=\"s\">(component</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (component $inner</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (core module $m</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (func (export \"f\") (param i32) (result i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        (i32.add (local.get 0) (i32.const 3))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (core instance $i (instantiate $m))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"f\") async (param \"x\" u32) (result u32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (canon lift (core func $i \"f\"))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (instance $inner (instantiate $inner))</span>\n\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $f (canon lower (func $inner \"f\")))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core module $m</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"f\" (func $f (param i32) (result i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"run\") (param i32) (result i32) (call $f (local.get 0))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core instance $i (instantiate $m (with \"\" (instance (export \"f\" (func $f))))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"run\") (param \"x\" u32) (result u32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon lift (core func $i \"run\")))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">\"#</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Store</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Linker</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">instantiate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">u32</span><span class=\"p\">,),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">u32</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"{:?}\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,)));</span